{"severity":"error","file":"errors/missing_impl_6.march","start_line":4,"start_col":4,"end_line":4,"end_col":17,"message":"String does not implement Num (only Int and Float do).\n`+` needs it here.","code":"missing_impl","fix":null,"labels":[],"notes":["March joins strings with `++`, not `+`. To put a number in a string, convert it first: `\"total: \" ++ int_to_string(n)`."],"category":"INTERFACE"}
